          "key": "raise-concurrency",
          "kind": "suggestion",
          "name": "raise-concurrency",
          "near": false,
          "quality_risk": false,
          "reason": "running requests hit max_concurrent_requests 4 with 124 waiting, and the highest sampled KV-cache usage is only 17.3%; at your declared load of 128 concurrent clients, up to 128 requests were in flight, so 16 is worth trying (the load is what your configuration declares, not measured traffic). It usually cuts queueing (TTFT) but slows each token (TPOT) as more sequences share every step - measure both",
          "tier": "try_first"
        },
        {
          "audience": "all",
          "item": false,
          "key": "could_help",
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Could help:",
          "tone": "plain"
